  "translate_en|mods/Frockin Splendor! Vol.5/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_FcknSpldrV5_LootBetaCommon_tooltip": "This is the loot multiplier for common spawns (default chance more than 1.000) for Frockin Splendor! Vol.5, such as items that are spawning in commercial areas. Set the number to 0 to stop this category from spawning, set the number to 10 to have them appear in almost all containers.",
